<https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/HSE-ERM-ControlOntology#Controls> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Controls are measures that maintain and/or modify risk. In the HSE, a control is a measure that is in place, is working effectively and operating to reduce either the likelihood or impact of a risk."@en .
<https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/HSE-ERM-ControlOntology#Controls> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Controls"@en .
