<https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/HSE-ERM-ControlOntology#SecondLineOfDefence> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "the way the organisation oversees the control framework so that it operates effectively. The assurance provided is separate from those responsible for delivery, but not independent of the management chain, such as risk and compliance functions."@en .
<https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/HSE-ERM-ControlOntology#SecondLineOfDefence> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Second line of defence"@en .
