<https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/HSE-ERM-ControlOntology#TargetRisk> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/creator> "Nick McDonald" .
<https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/HSE-ERM-ControlOntology#TargetRisk> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> <https://www2.healthservice.hse.ie/organisation/national-pppgs/hse-integrated-risk-management-policy/> .
