<https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/HSE-ERM-ControlOntology#TargetRisk> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Target risk in the HSE is the planned level of risk after consideration of both control and action measures."@en .
