<https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/HSE-ERM-ControlOntology#ThirdLineOfDefence> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> <https://www2.healthservice.hse.ie/organisation/national-pppgs/hse-integrated-risk-management-policy/> .
<https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/HSE-ERM-ControlOntology#ThirdLineOfDefence> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/HSE-ERM-ControlOntology#> .
<https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/HSE-ERM-ControlOntology#ThirdLineOfDefence> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "objective and independent assurance, e.g. internal audit, providing reasonable (not absolute) assurance of the overall effectiveness of governance, risk management and controls."@en .
<https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/HSE-ERM-ControlOntology#ThirdLineOfDefence> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Third line of defence"@en .
# 
# https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/HSE-ERM-ControlOntology#TransferRisk
<https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/HSE-ERM-ControlOntology#TransferRisk> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/HSE-ERM-ControlOntology#TransferRisk> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/created> "2024-05-15"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/HSE-ERM-ControlOntology#TransferRisk> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/creator> "Nick McDonald" .
<https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/HSE-ERM-ControlOntology#TransferRisk> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> <https://www2.healthservice.hse.ie/organisation/national-pppgs/hse-integrated-risk-management-policy/> .
